OL,3,GNEWSATravelodge victim calls for hotel
OL,4,Asecurity guidelines
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who was sexually assaulted by a
OL,7,Fman who was given a key to her hotel
OL,8,Froom has called for a national
OL,9,Fframework for hotel security.
OL,11,FThe victim, who cannot be named for
OL,12,Flegal reasons, was attacked by Kyran
OL,13,FSmith after he was given a key to her
OL,14,Froom at a Travelodge in Maidenhead,
OL,15,FBerkshire, in December 2022.
OL,17,FHer ordeal, along with reports from
OL,18,Fdozens of other guests, led to
OL,19,FTravelodge commissioning an independent
OL,20,Freview into security, which was
OL,21,Freleased this week and was highly
OL,22,Fcritical of the hotel chain.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,340,330,200,160,0,100
