OL,3,GNEWSATravelodge victim calls for hotel
OL,4,Asecurity guidelines
OL,5,
OL,6,FResponding to the findings, interim
OL,7,Fchief executive of Travelodge Ray Reidy
OL,8,Ftold the BBC "nobody is working harder
OL,9,Fon security of rooms in this industry
OL,10,Fthan we are today".
